Package: mcpconsole
Title: Use MCP Console with 'ellmer'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a thin 'ellmer' tool wrapper around the MCP Console
    server. The package resolves the 'mcp-console' executable with
    'reticulate', manages the server process with 'processx', and forwards the
    server's single tool over its standard input and output streams.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/mcp-console
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/mcp-console/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ellmer (>= 0.4.2),
    jsonlite,
    processx,
    reticulate (>= 1.41.0),
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.1.8)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
